# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# alice — entity .gitignore
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This template ships no key material. Everything below exists to keep the key
# material your machine generates from ever reaching a remote.
#
# Rule of thumb: identity is generated on the device that owns it. A private
# key that leaves its machine has to be rotated, and rotating identity is a
# ceremony, not a git operation.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets: never, under any circumstances ──────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.secret*
.credentials
*.nsec
auth.json

# The shipped example is deliberately NOT ignored.
!.env.example

# ── Cryptographic identity (VESTA-SPEC-149 / SPEC-175) ───────────────────────
# id/ is excluded by CONTENTS, not by directory. A bare `id/` excludes the
# directory itself and git will not descend into an excluded directory, so
# every `!id/...` negation below would be dead code. `id/*` lets git descend
# and lets the negations actually take effect.
id/*
# Public half of the identity — safe, and other entities verify against it.
!id/entity.public.asc
!id/entity.fingerprint
!id/migrated-at
!id/archive/
!id/devices/
# Per-device private keys stay local. The public leaf is what travels.
id/devices/*/leaf.private.asc
id/devices/*/device.key

# Entity GPG keyring — private keys, never commit.
keyring/

# ── Wallets: derived, never persisted ────────────────────────────────────────
# VESTA-SPEC-113 derives the EVM wallet deterministically from id/ed25519.
# Persisting it writes a secp256k1 private key to a file git can track. The
# address can be recomputed at any time; the file cannot be un-leaked.
wallets/

# ── Derived artifacts (regenerate, do not author) ────────────────────────────
# AGENTS.md is the context cascade: KOAD_IO.md + ENTITY.md + PRIMER.md.
# Edit the sources; `koad-io init alice` rebuilds this.
AGENTS.md

# ── Runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.local/
var/
tmp/
.tmp/
logs/
*.log
sessions/
context-bubbles/

# ── Harness artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.claude.json
.opencode/
mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
.context
tui.json
tooltips/

# ── Build + dependency noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/

# ── Editor + OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
